      "taskMessage": "<b>Mara Voss:</b> Check which HTTP methods the portal accepts. Each should have a reason to be enabled.",
      "taskInstructions": "Read <link=\"u04_http_methods\"><u>HTTP methods</u></link>, then run <b>nikto -h https://portal.northbridge.com</b> in the terminal. Compare the reported methods with their purposes.",
